OL,3,GNEWSAMayor criticised over proposed new
OL,4,Abus tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new council tax charge could be
OL,7,Fintroduced in York and North Yorkshire
OL,8,Fto help fund local bus services.
OL,10,FLabour Mayor David Skaith has suggested
OL,11,Fintroducing a "transport precept" of
OL,12,Fbetween #2 and #6 per year.
OL,14,FAccording to the mayor's office the
OL,15,Flevy would raise between #650,000 and
OL,16,F#2m, which could be used to pay for
OL,17,Freduced bus fares for under 19s, free
OL,18,Fbus travel for care leavers and
OL,19,Fadditional services.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
